<h1>Experimental language-learning game</h1>

<p>
	This site tracks the development of an experimental language-learning game
	built around participation instead of drills.
</p>

<p>The project explores:</p>

<ul>
	<li>social simulation</li>
	<li>interactive drama</li>
	<li>language acquisition through participation</li>
	<li>AI-driven characters</li>
</ul>

<p>Posts here document prototypes, design decisions, and playable experiments.</p>

